Embedder permission policy: share Chromium overrides and subscription updates.

A side-effect-free per-document status hook precedes context overrides, with
normal context validation. Prompt overrides delegate requests. Context/CDP
mutations notify the embedder before subscriptions are recomputed; native
state mutations snapshot and notify the same Chromium subscriptions.
Revision ordering lives in the actual scope-aware permission override table,
not a second embedder copy. Public bridge functions preserve encapsulation.
Shell document requests can be taken asynchronously without changing defaults.

